            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[
            <h3>What's new in Silica 0.4.0</h3>
			<ul>
					<li>Port latest commits from <a href="https://github.com/dqhieu/Silica" target="_blank">dqhieu/Silica</a></li>
					<li>Preview HTML with unsaved edits, project assets and scripts</li>
					<li>Add Finder folder icons, external drag support and a tab action to reveal files in the explorer</li>
				</ul>
			]]></description>
